      "created_at": "2015-09-03T12:02:10.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>There were prior discussions for movie actors that could apply here too&nbsp;https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/sentinels-movie-casting-6169 and&nbsp;https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/sentinels-movie-casting-2831</p><p>Tim Daly is pretty much who I expect for Legacy considering what he has done in the past. &nbsp; &nbsp;Along with him I feel Kevin Conroy should be Absolute Zero since it wouldn't make sense for him to be Wraith and AZ is the loner type like Batman seems to be. &nbsp; To be honest I would say between the Batman and Superman animated series you could probably match them all up with a Sentinels character. &nbsp;</p>",
